---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const serviceSchema = {"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Service", "name": "BOLT lithium golf cart battery replacement & conversion", "serviceType": "Golf cart lithium battery replacement and lead-acid-to-lithium conversion", "url": "https://mastersgolfcars.com/lithium-golf-cart-batteries/", "provider": {"@type": "LocalBusiness", "name": "Masters Golf Cars", "address": {"@type": "PostalAddress", "streetAddress": "12885 S US Hwy 441", "addressLocality": "Belleview", "addressRegion": "FL", "postalCode": "34420", "addressCountry": "US"}}};
---
<Layout title="BOLT Lithium Golf Cart Batteries & Conversion | Belleview" description="BOLT lithium battery replacement and lead-acid conversions at Masters Golf Cars in Belleview. Pickup and delivery available. Call for an installed quote.">
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(serviceSchema)} />
  <article class="battery-service">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">BOLT lithium battery service</p><h1>BOLT lithium golf cart battery replacement & conversion</h1><p class="intro">Replace an existing lithium battery or convert a lead-acid golf cart to BOLT lithium with Masters Golf Cars. Service is available at our Belleview shop, with pickup and delivery available for owners who need help getting their cart to us.</p><a class="call" href="tel:+13523070111">Call (352) 307-0111 for a quote</a></header>
    <div class="service-content"><section><h2>Replacement or conversion: which service do you need?</h2><p>If your cart already uses lithium, ask about a replacement that suits its existing electrical system. If it has lead-acid batteries, request a conversion quote. Tell us the make, model, year, and current battery setup so we can discuss the right service for your cart.</p></section>
<section><h2>Plan your BOLT installation</h2><p>Before booking, ask what the proposed installation includes: the selected battery, any required charger or mounting components, labor, and checks for your cart. Compatibility depends on the individual cart. We will discuss your setup before you commit to a replacement or conversion.</p></section>
<section><h2>Service at our Belleview shop</h2><p>Bring your cart to Masters Golf Cars at 12885 S US Hwy 441, Belleview, FL 34420 by arrangement. Pickup and delivery are also available. Call with your location to confirm scheduling, transport details, and any charges before booking.</p></section>
<section><h2>Get a quote for your cart</h2><p>Have your cart details and a photo of its current battery label ready. Describe any charging problems or reduced run time, and tell us how you normally use the cart. Ask for the installed price, expected timing, and warranty terms for the specific BOLT battery being quoted.</p></section>
      <section class="next-step"><h2>Ready to discuss your cart?</h2><p>Call (352) 307-0111 with your cart details and preferred service dates. Confirm battery selection, installed pricing, pickup and delivery, and warranty terms before booking.</p><nav aria-label="Battery service next steps"><a href="/golf-cart-repairs/">General repairs and maintenance</a><a href="/schedule-golf-cart-service/">Request battery service</a><a href="/blog/lithium-battery-conversion-guide/">Read the lithium conversion guide</a></nav></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
<style>
.battery-service { color:#172b24; background:#fff; }
.battery-service header { background:#edf5ef; padding:4rem max(1.25rem,calc((100% - 1080px)/2)); }
.eyebrow { color:#245638; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; font-size:.85rem; }
h1 { font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3.5rem); line-height:1.12; font-weight:800; max-width:950px; margin:1rem 0 1.5rem; }
p { line-height:1.8; font-size:1.1rem; }
.intro { max-width:850px; }
.call { display:inline-block; background:#185936; color:white; padding:1rem 1.4rem; border-radius:.5rem; margin-top:1.5rem; font-weight:700; }
.service-content { max-width:1080px; padding:1rem 1.25rem 4rem; margin:auto; }
section { margin-top:2.75rem; max-width:900px; }
h2 { font-size:1.7rem; line-height:1.3; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:1rem; }
.next-step { background:#f2f6f3; padding:1.5rem; border-radius:.75rem; }
nav { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem 2rem; margin-top:1rem; }
nav a { color:#185936; text-decoration:underline; font-weight:700; }
a:focus-visible { outline:3px solid #b17d11; outline-offset:4px; }
</style>
